{"id":"853d73c57bd2049d","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md","title":"Root of Unity","display":"df-root-of-unity — Root of Unity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-root-of-unity","aliases":["58-df-root-of-unity"],"display":"df-root-of-unity — Root of Unity","depends_on":["[[58-df-field]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-root-of-unity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-root-of-unity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-root-of-unity — Root of Unity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\in V\">\\(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\in V\\)</span> (field structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (positive integer)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta\\in K\">\\(\\zeta\\in K\\)</span> (element)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_n(K)\">\\(\\mu_n(K)\\)</span> (nth roots of unity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RootOfUnity}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RootOfUnity}_S\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}root\\text{-}of\\text{-}unity\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S(\\zeta,n,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\zeta\\in K\\land\\exists a\\in K^{n+1}\\;(a(0)=1_K\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;a(j+1)=\\cdot_K(\\langle a(j),\\zeta\\rangle)\\land a(n)=1_K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}root\\text{-}of\\text{-}unity\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S(\\zeta,n,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\zeta\\in K\\land\\exists a\\in K^{n+1}\\;(a(0)=1_K\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;a(j+1)=\\cdot_K(\\langle a(j),\\zeta\\rangle)\\land a(n)=1_K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}root\\text{-}of\\text{-}unity\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{RootOfUnity}_S(\\zeta,n,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\in V\\;\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S(\\zeta,n,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}root\\text{-}of\\text{-}unity\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{RootOfUnity}_S(\\zeta,n,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\in V\\;\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S(\\zeta,n,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}root\\text{-}of\\text{-}unity\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(K)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\to\\mu_n(K)=\\{\\zeta\\in K:\\mathrm{RootOfUnity}_S(\\zeta,n,K)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}root\\text{-}of\\text{-}unity\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(K)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\to\\mu_n(K)=\\{\\zeta\\in K:\\mathrm{RootOfUnity}_S(\\zeta,n,K)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The explicit predicate fixes the multiplication and its unit; the three-argument form existentially projects the field structure used by downstream atoms.</li>\n<li>Roots of unity are torsion elements of the multiplicative group.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ (field predicate, see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb{N}_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta\\in K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_n(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RootOfUnity}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}root\\text{-}of\\text{-}unity\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S(\\zeta,n,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land\\zeta\\in K\\land\\exists a\\in K^{n+1}\\;(a(0)=1_K\\land\\forall j<n\\;a(j+1)=\\cdot_K(\\langle a(j),\\zeta\\rangle)\\land a(n)=1_K)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}root\\text{-}of\\text{-}unity\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{RootOfUnity}_S(\\zeta,n,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\in V\\;\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S(\\zeta,n,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}root\\text{-}of\\text{-}unity\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(K)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\to\\mu_n(K)=\\{\\zeta\\in K:\\mathrm{RootOfUnity}_S(\\zeta,n,K)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1577,"backlinks":[{"id":"97f9e7d6cde71381","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md|58-df-root-of-unity]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda"]}